# ✅ Modern Todo App

A modern, responsive, and feature-rich **Todo Application** built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. Organize your daily tasks with a beautiful Glassmorphism interface, task priorities, live search, filters, local storage support, and productivity-focused features.

