# 🚀 Getting Started

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/probal2005/Modern-Todo-App.git
```

## Open Project

Simply open

```text
index.html
```

in your favorite browser.

No installation required.

---

# 📖 How to Use

### ➕

Type your task

Choose priority

Click **+**

or press

```text
Ctrl + Enter
```

---

### ✔ Complete

Click the checkbox.

---

### ✏ Edit

Click the blue edit button.

---

### 🗑 Delete

Click the red delete button.

---

### 🔎 Search

Use the search box to instantly filter tasks.

---

### 📂 Filter

Choose

- All
- Pending
- Completed

---

### 🧹 Clear Completed

Removes only completed tasks.

---

### 🗑 Clear All

Deletes every task.

